notes: V021 remains the active unaccepted candidate. In addition to traffic occupancy analytics and counting regions, this refinement replaces decorative time-based simulation motion with persistent signal-aware agents: vehicles use road lanes and queue at stop lines, pedestrians use the zebra crossing and wait at the curb, and both obey a deterministic vehicle/yellow/all-red/WALK/CLEAR cycle. The active simulation signal is exposed in camera status and the traffic-state phase is aligned to that signal while detection-driven phase output is retained as recommendation metadata. V020 remains the previous candidate and the owner-confirmed passed baseline remains V017 / 0_1_7. Occupancy samples are not unique object passage counts because cross-frame tracking is not implemented. Physical public-road traffic control remains disabled.
